  "title": "The BOM manipulates observations into new datasets in order to give a...",
  "description": "The BOM manipulates observations into new datasets in order to give a false impression that the temperature is increasing. In the recent round of estimates I asked the BOM if they acknowledged that their homogenisation artificially increased the temperature rise of the last 100 years. They lied in their reply by saying that if they didn’t homogenise their records the increase would have been bigger. This was a blatant lie. C7 of the Independent Peer Review points out the Bureau homogenised (fudged) temperatures down prior to 1940. There is also a table at the bottom of page 29 in the ACORN2 report that shows the homogenisation dataset has lifted the original mean observations by 0.43 degrees. It’s worth noting as well that the boxes (called Stevenson screens) that the thermometers are stored in have decreased in size as well. Another independent peer review (see link in comments) showed the new smaller screens increased recorded temperatures by 0.54 degrees on average over the course of a year with mean temperatures increasing by up to 0.92 degrees in summer. These two changes alone have increased the recorded increase in temperature by 1 whole degree which has nothing to do with climate change. Thermometers have also changed with the new platinum resistor thermometers showing higher temperatures than the old mercury ones. Unsurprisingly the BOM failed to do a robust parallel run when changing its equipment knowing that temperatures would read higher as a result. BOM executives were recently chided by a Federal Court Judge for lying. It seems they never learn. #auspol #australia #climatechange #netzero #BOM #BureauofMeteorology",
